    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Up to six creatures in a 40-ft cube make a WIS save. On a failure: half speed, -2 to AC and DEX saves, no Reactions, an action or a Bonus Action (not both) and one attack per turn, and a 25% chance a Somatic spell fails. Repeat the save at the end of each of its turns. The action limits and spell failure are the DM's to apply.</p>",
